TITLE Water (150C) equilibrated with fixed-P gas mixture (CH4, CO2, NH3)
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7
    pe 4
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 150
    CH4(g) 0.4 10
    CO2(g) 0.4 10
    NH3(g) 0.2 5
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -totals N
END
